@startuml link-state
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam shadowing false
title Behaviour — SerialLink connection state
[*] --> Waiting
Waiting : device path missing\nor cannot be opened
Waiting --> Handshake : device opened
Waiting --> Waiting : retry every reconnect_s
Handshake : C, V, S<n>, O
Handshake --> Connected : O acknowledged
Handshake --> Waiting : no ack / I/O error
Connected : forward both directions\nconnected = set
Connected --> Lost : read/write error (EIO, unplug)
Lost : connected cleared, port closed\nqueue drained, disconnects++
Lost --> Waiting : after reconnect_s
Connected --> Closed : SIGINT / SIGTERM
Closed : send C (ECU safe state)\nclose port
Closed --> [*]
@enduml
